OL,3,GNEWSAShane Richie banned from driving
OL,4,Aafter speeding
OL,5,
OL,6,FEastEnders actor Shane Richie has been
OL,7,Fbanned from driving for six months
OL,8,Fafter he was caught speeding.
OL,10,FCourt records have revealed that the
OL,11,F62-year-old, real name Shane Roche, was
OL,12,Fhit with the driving ban on 23
OL,13,FSeptember after he admitted the
OL,14,Foffence.
OL,16,FHe was also fined #500 at Guildford
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court and ordered to pay
OL,18,F#320 in costs and a surcharge.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
